## 5. Mission axes A–I — verified from code (not from prior report)
- **A CENTRAL OWNER GATE** ✓ — `dispatch_callback` gates via `_callback_requires_owner`
  (`_MUTATING_CALLBACK_SCHEMES = {app,rfc,home,act,rev,jrn,acct,prop}` + mutating menu pages) →
  `_callback_owner_ok(from_id)`. Mutating callback with `external=True` or a real `from_id` that isn't
  owner → rejected before sub-dispatch. `from_id=None` passes only as a trusted in-process seam
  (`trusted_internal`). Covered by `test_telegram_group_allowlist` / `test_telegram_rfc_router` (green).
- **B DURABLE APPROVAL CARD STATE MACHINE** ✓ — `prepare_money_card` persists non-secret binding +
  `nonce` + `token_sha256` (raw token NOT on disk); delivery PENDING→LEASED→SENT; `persist_money_decision`
  (DENIED/DEFERRED durable); `verify_callback` re-checks owner+expiry+HMAC+binding at click; approve →
  `EffectorGate.release_effect` only; unknown amount / missing secret → fail-closed (no AU$0.00).
  Covered by `test_pending_card_recovery` (12, green).
- **C RFC CLAIM/APPLY/ACK EXACTLY-ONCE** ✓ — `verify_rfc_callback` (durable SUBMITTED + nonce);
  `persist_rfc_verdict` before ack; `claim_rfc_verdicts(worker,lease)` + `begin_rfc_apply(op_key)` +
  `ack_rfc_verdict(applied,receipt)`; doctor uses explicit `hasattr(claim_rfc_verdicts)` (not MagicMock
  ambiguity — tests pin path via `spec`). Legacy `pop_rfc_verdicts` is adapter-only. Covered by
  `test_merge_applies_knob`, `test_p0_security_fixes`, `test_chamber_temperature` (green).
- **D BOOT ORDER** ✓ — organism: `boot_recovery` (309) + `rebuild_money_cards` (341) run BEFORE the
  Telegram poller thread starts (`run_forever`, 363). `make_telegram_channel` does not auto-poll.
  Recovery-before-poller invariant holds.
- **E BEAT ACT/LEARN EXACTLY-ONCE** ✓ — RESERVED/COMMITTED/DEGRADED + `committed_counter` (advances only
  on checked commit) + `recovery_block` (an incomplete/crossed-ACT beat runs safe-phase/advisory-only
  until reconciled) + `production_safe` (ACT_ARMED ignored until an operation-level outbox/receipt
  exists). Shadow composition is structurally ACT/LEARN-free. Covered by `test_beat_scheduler` (13, green).
- **F RESEARCH RESUME + ADMISSION ATOMICITY** ✓ — per-lane `resume_point` from research-journal;
  `plan_recovery` (DETECTED); `find_completed(experiment_key)` idempotent resume (no rerun / no dup
  artifact) + promotion path; final-ledger-fail → memory retracted (compensation). Covered by
  `test_research_loop` (16, green).
- **G REAL SEMANTIC PARITY** ✓ — only the typed `health-contract-v1` comparator gates promotion (RECORD
  stream-count is coverage telemetry, not parity); `soak_fingerprint` restarts the soak on code/schema
  change; missing authoritative source blocks green; PARITY-GREEN needs ≥24h continuous. Covered by
  `test_brain_core` (green).
- **H EVIDENCE ARTIFACT** — C7.2 authoritative barrier suite artifact saved (see §6).
- **I TEST ISOLATION** ✓ — env-leak removed (telegram owner); durable stores reset per-test where shared
